|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| P1 | 0 | 7 | 7 | 7 | 0 | 0 |
| P2 | 0 | 5 | 12 | 12 | 7 | 7 |
| P3 | 0 | 3 | 15 | 15 | 12 | 12 |
| P4 | 0 | 6 | 21 | 21 | 15 | 15 |

