### Key concepts for your viva:

| Term | Formula | Meaning |
|---|---|---|
| **Completion Time** | CT = previous CT + BT | When process finishes |
| **Turnaround Time** | TAT = CT - AT | Total time from arrival to finish |
| **Waiting Time** | WT = TAT - BT | Time spent waiting in ready queue |
| **Response Time** | RT = first scheduled - AT | Time from arrival to first CPU allocation |

> **Note:** In FCFS, Response Time = Waiting Time because every process runs to completion without preemption — once a process gets CPU it never gives it up until done.

