### Explanation of each requirement:

| Requirement | How it's handled |
|---|---|
| **fork() purpose** | Creates two independent processes from one |
| **Parent prints even** | `else` block (pid > 0) prints even numbers |
| **Child prints odd** | `else if(pid == 0)` block prints odd numbers |
| **Both execute independently** | No synchronization between printing loops |
| **Parent waits for child** | `wait(NULL)` holds parent until child calls `exit(0)` |
| **Error handling** | `if(pid < 0)` handles fork failure |

